  stickyNoteTexts:
  - 'Great job on the last one!


    Think you can handle this bigger artifact?
    You got this! :)


    -Ms. Maya :)'
  - p.s So it is true! So were you born and raised in the Netherlands? I heard they
    have amazing museums there, including the museum we got these returned Indonesian
    artifacts from!
